---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import baywalkCat from '../assets/photos/about-baywalk-cat.jpg';
import esplanadeBridge from '../assets/photos/about-esplanade-bridge.jpg';
import taipeiStreet from '../assets/photos/about-taipei-street.jpg';
import { siteLinks } from '../data/site';

const workOn = [
  'Audience intelligence and segmentation',
  'Digital audits and strategy',
  'Analytics and reporting systems',
  'Content strategy and editorial direction',
  'E-commerce acquisition and retention',
  'Automation, prototypes, and operational design',
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Archieval Mariano"
  description="Archieval Mariano is a digital strategy and audience growth professional based in the Philippines, working across content, analytics, e-commerce, and digital operations."
>
  <header class="about-cover wrap">
    <p class="about-cover__chapter"><span>02</span> About</p>
    <div>
      <p class="about-cover__kicker">A working introduction</p>
      <h1>Archieval<br />Mariano</h1>
      <p class="about-cover__lede">
        I used to call myself the bored storyteller. The name still fits. I remain
        restless, curious, and interested in the stories people, places, and seemingly
        ordinary things have to tell.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="origin wrap" aria-labelledby="origin-title">
    <p class="section-number">01</p>
    <h2 id="origin-title">The heart of it</h2>
    <div class="origin__body">
      <p class="origin__lead">
        The heart of it has always been writing.
      </p>
      <p>
        I was drawn to the way a word can change meaning through context, placement,
        or tone. I still enjoy taking a familiar fact, trope, or saying and turning it
        on its head. For me, writing has always been part expression and part puzzle.
      </p>
      <p>
        That instinct eventually led me beyond copy. Data is another way of finding a
        narrative. Strategy is deciding which patterns matter and what to do with them.
        Operations turn that conclusion into something people can repeat. They are
        different materials, but I approach them with the same desire to make something
        complicated clearer.
      </p>
      <p>
        The path has taken me through editorial, branded content, e-commerce, analytics,
        audience development, digital strategy, and the systems that connect them.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <aside class="experience-band">
    <div class="wrap experience-band__inner">
      <p>Selected experience</p>
      <ul>
        <li>GMA New Media Inc.</li>
        <li>SM Investments Corporation</li>
        <li>Summit Media</li>
        <li>Independent consulting</li>
      </ul>
      <strong>More than a decade across digital work.</strong>
    </div>
  </aside>

  <section class="work-map wrap" aria-labelledby="work-map-title">
    <p class="section-number">02</p>
    <h2 id="work-map-title">What I work on</h2>
    <ol>
      {workOn.map((item, index) => <li><span>0{index + 1}</span>{item}</li>)}
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="philosophy wrap" aria-labelledby="philosophy-title">
    <p class="section-number section-number--light">03</p>
    <h2 id="philosophy-title">How I work</h2>
    <blockquote>
      I usually see the ending first.
    </blockquote>
    <div class="philosophy__body">
      <p>
        When I was writing, I often knew the final line, the kicker, or the quote I wanted
        to end on before I had written the opening. The difficult and interesting part was
        finding the right way there.
      </p>
      <p>
        I work similarly now. I begin with a clear outcome and work backward through the
        decisions needed to reach it. The difficult and interesting part is finding the
        right way there.
      </p>
      <p>
        The result still has to survive contact with actual work. It should make sense to
        the people using it, respect the limits they work within, and remain useful after
        the presentation ends.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="outside wrap" aria-labelledby="outside-title">
    <p class="section-number">04</p>
    <h2 id="outside-title">Away<br />from the<br />dashboards</h2>
    <div class="outside__body">
      <p class="outside__lead">Pretends to be a photographer and a good writer.</p>
      <p>
        That is how I describe myself on Instagram, where I post photographs and the
        occasional poem or piece of prose. It captures my discomfort with calling myself
        a photographer, or even a good writer, despite spending years taking photographs
        and writing.
      </p>
      <p>
        In my twenties, I built trips around hostels and long journeys over land, saving
        on comfort so I could spend more on experience. I still travel, but I no longer
        treat discomfort as proof that a trip mattered. I move more slowly now, chase
        fewer attractions, and leave more room to notice what is actually there.
      </p>
      <p>
        I am told I am an amazing conversationalist. I choose to interpret that as being
        an acquired taste.
      </p>
      <div class="outside__links">
        <a class="button" href="/contact">Find out for yourself</a>
        <a href={siteLinks.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-ga-event="linkedin_click">View my full record on LinkedIn<span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in new tab)</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="outside__gallery" aria-label="Selected photographs from my personal archive" oncontextmenu="return false">
      <figure class="outside__photo outside__photo--taipei">
        <Image
          src={taipeiStreet}
          alt="A vertical view along Chang'an West Road in Taipei, framed by buildings and road markings"
          widths={[444, 666, 888]}
          sizes="(max-width: 832px) 100vw, 34vw"
          format="webp"
          quality={74}
          loading="lazy"
          draggable="false"
        />
        <figcaption>
          <span class="outside__caption-copy">
            <strong>A very vertical panorama</strong>
            <span lang="zh-Hant">長安西路，臺北</span>
          </span>
          <span class="outside__credit">Personal archive</span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="outside__photo outside__photo--cat">
        <Image
          src={baywalkCat}
          alt="A black-and-white cat walking beside Manila Bay on a bright Sunday morning"
          widths={[720, 1100, 1600]}
          sizes="(max-width: 832px) 100vw, 58vw"
          format="webp"
          quality={74}
          loading="lazy"
          draggable="false"
        />
        <figcaption>Sunday morning along the baywalk, Pasay <span class="outside__credit">Personal archive</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="outside__photo outside__photo--bridge">
        <Image
          src={esplanadeBridge}
          alt="A brightly lit convenience store framed by the dark underside of Esplanade Bridge in Singapore"
          widths={[720, 1100, 1600]}
          sizes="(max-width: 832px) 100vw, 58vw"
          format="webp"
          quality={74}
          loading="lazy"
          draggable="false"
        />
        <figcaption>Beneath Esplanade Bridge, Singapore <span class="outside__credit">Personal archive</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-cover {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(9rem, .3fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem clamp(2rem, 8vw, 9rem);
    padding-top: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 9rem);
    padding-bottom: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 9rem);
  }
  .about-cover__chapter, .section-number { margin: 0; font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-faint); }
  .about-cover__chapter span { display: block; width: fit-content; margin-bottom: .65rem; padding: .35rem .5rem; background: var(--coral); border: 1px solid var(--ink); color: var(--ink); }
  .about-cover__kicker { margin: 0 0 var(--space-sm); font-size: .74rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--coral); }
  .about-cover h1 { max-width: 9ch; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: clamp(4.2rem, 11vw, 11rem); font-weight: 780; letter-spacing: -.025em; line-height: .8; }
  .about-cover__lede { max-width: 48rem; margin: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 6rem) 0 0; font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.4vw, 2.3rem); line-height: 1.42; }
  .origin, .work-map, .philosophy, .outside { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 4rem minmax(15rem, .45fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: clamp(1.2rem, 4vw, 4rem); padding-top: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 8rem); padding-bottom: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 8rem); border-top: var(--heavy-rule); }
  .origin h2, .work-map h2, .philosophy h2, .outside h2 { max-width: 12ch; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4vw, 4.8rem); font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -.05em; line-height: .95; }
  .origin__body, .philosophy__body, .outside__body { max-width: 46rem; font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 1.7vw, 1.5rem); line-height: 1.58; }
  .origin__lead { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 3rem); line-height: 1.15; color: var(--ink); }
  .experience-band { background: var(--yellow); border-block: var(--heavy-rule); }
  .experience-band__inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 11rem minmax(0, 1fr) 15rem; gap: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 5rem); align-items: start; padding-top: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem); padding-bottom: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem); }
  .experience-band p { margin: 0; font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .experience-band ul { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: .7rem 2rem; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: var(--step-1); }
  .experience-band li { padding-bottom: .55rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink); }
  .experience-band strong { font-size: .85rem; line-height: 1.4; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .work-map ol { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0; margin: 0; padding: 0; border-top: var(--heavy-rule); border-left: var(--heavy-rule); list-style: none; }
  .work-map li { min-height: 10rem; padding: 1.25rem; border-right: var(--heavy-rule); border-bottom: var(--heavy-rule); font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: var(--step-1); }
  .work-map li span { display: block; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 800; }
  .philosophy { color: var(--paper); background: var(--blue-dark); box-shadow: 0 0 0 100vmax var(--blue-dark); clip-path: inset(0 -100vmax); border: 0; }
  .section-number--light { color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--paper) 65%, transparent); }
  .philosophy blockquote { max-width: 15ch; margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 3.2vw, 3.8rem); font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -.045em; line-height: 1; }
  .philosophy__body { grid-column: 3; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--paper) 82%, transparent); }
  .philosophy a { color: var(--paper); text-decoration-color: var(--yellow); }
  .outside h2 { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 3.25vw, 4rem); letter-spacing: -.04em; }
  .outside__lead { margin-top: 0; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 3rem); line-height: 1.15; color: var(--ink); }
  .outside__links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.5rem 2rem; align-items: center; margin-top: var(--space-lg); font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .outside__links .button { padding: .8rem 1rem; color: var(--paper); background: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; border: 2px solid var(--ink); box-shadow: .3rem .3rem 0 var(--coral); }
  .outside__gallery { grid-column: 2 / 4; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(16rem, .52fr) minmax(0, 1fr); grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr; gap: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 2rem); margin-top: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem); user-select: none; }
  .outside__photo { position: relative; min-width: 0; margin: 0; overflow: hidden; background: var(--ink); border: var(--heavy-rule); }
  .outside__photo--taipei { grid-row: 1 / 3; }
  .outside__photo--cat, .outside__photo--bridge { aspect-ratio: 3 / 2; }
  .outside__photo :global(img) { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; pointer-events: none; }
  .outside__photo--taipei :global(img) { object-position: 50% 50%; }
  .outside__photo figcaption { position: absolute; inset: auto 0 0; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; padding: .7rem .9rem; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 92%, transparent); color: var(--paper); font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: .66rem; font-weight: 750; line-height: 1.35; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .outside__caption-copy { display: grid; gap: .15rem; }
  .outside__caption-copy strong { font: inherit; }
  .outside__caption-copy span { color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--paper) 72%, transparent); font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .04em; text-transform: none; }
  .outside__credit { flex: 0 0 auto; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--paper) 65%, transparent); }
  @media (max-width: 52rem) {
    .about-cover { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .origin, .work-map, .philosophy, .outside { grid-template-columns: 2rem 1fr; }
    .origin__body, .work-map ol, .philosophy blockquote, .philosophy__body, .outside__body, .outside__gallery { grid-column: 2; }
    .outside__gallery { grid-template-columns: 1fr; grid-template-rows: auto; }
    .outside__photo--taipei { grid-row: auto; aspect-ratio: 2 / 3; }
    .experience-band__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 36rem) {
    .work-map ol, .experience-band ul { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .outside__photo figcaption { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: .2rem; }
  }
</style>
